          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiseesi cha Solomoni choosi che khunywelamo chaba che esahabu. Ne bibiindu bioosi bie mu lichipi lie kumusiru kwa Lebanoni biaba bie esahabu tikinyi: Mbao sisiaba sie efwesa tawe, sikila efwesa se yabalwa khuba eye bukhala bwosi bwosi mu ndaalo cha Solomoni tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami aba ne kamatuuli ke chimeeli khu nyanja ne kamatuuli ke chimeeli cha Hiramu. Buli enyuma we kimiiko kitaru, kamatuuli ke chimeeli chewe kareeranga esahabu, efwesa, kimisaanga, wambumuli ne chinguke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
